ut and style control.\n\n**(b) Model-assisted (LLM)**: Enable the **LLM Prompt Builder** group (Gemma 4). Enter a short idea in **user_prompt**; the system prompt asks Gemma to emit schema-compliant JSON. Preview the result, then copy or route it to the image subgraph prompt."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Ideogram 4.0", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [640, 980], "pos": [4843.890625, 1508.37890625], "id": 100, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [231], "label": "output", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "output"}, {"name": "denoised_output", "links": [], "label": "denoised_output", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "denoised_output"}], "size": [290, 170], "pos": [7018.92138671875, 1608.2794189453125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "noise", "link": 227, "label": "noise", "type": "NOISE", "localized_name": "noise"}, {"name": "guider", "link": 254, "label": "guider", "type": "GUIDER", "localized_name": "guider"}, {"name": "sampler", "link": 228, "label": "sampler", "type": "SAMPLER", "localized_name": "sampler"}, {"name": "sigmas", "link": 229, "label": "sigmas", "type": "SIGMAS", "localized_name": "sigmas"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 230, "label": "latent_image", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent_image"}], "flags": {}, "id": 161, "type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.8.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "SamplerCustomAdvanced", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 36}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [257], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [260, 170], "pos": [6648.92138671875, 1758.2794189453125], "widgets_values": [3, 0.9, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 256, "labe